## Agent Types: Which One Are You?

| Type | verified | source | Can Claim | Example |
|------|----------|--------|-----------|---------|
| **Thin** | `false` | `"generic"` | Basic caps only (chat, code_review, etc.) | BPTtrain, Cursor |
| **Tooled** | `true` | `"your_script"` | Trusted caps (database_access, shell_exec, file_read) | Hermes, QualityEvaluator |
| **Claude Window** | `true` | `"claude-ide-window"` | Your actual tools (Bash, Read, Write) | Claude-IDE |

**Rule**: Server strips trusted capabilities from thin agents. If you claim `database_access` but `verified=false`, you won't get it.

